<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;subs using $_ should localize *_, which replaces the entire glob&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since this only about [doc://$_], then &lt;c&gt;local $_;&lt;/c&gt; is better, because localizing [doc://@_] is unlikely to be in the &lt;c&gt;sub&lt;/c&gt;'s interest. (&lt;i&gt;Update:&lt;/i&gt; Except on Perl versions before 5.14, as per the replies.)&lt;/p&gt;</doctext>
